# Research workspace (edge-discovery study): kept local and out of this repo.
# It is a self-contained study — source, multi-GB market data, generated reports and
# the experiment registry — with its own lifecycle, and its outputs would otherwise
# churn a large diff on every run. backend/src/routes/research.ts serves its reports
# when the folder is present locally and returns a 404 with an explanation when it
# is not, so nothing here depends on it.
research/
